 with unclear stress.","focus":"Natural rhythm in short present-simple routine sentences.","model":"I do my homework.","tip":"Listen, pause, and repeat in one clear thought group."}],"vocabulary":[{"audio_key":"a1_study_t05_l06_vocab_01","example":"I use the word ''homework'' in this lesson.","image_key":"a1_study_t05_l06_vocab_01","meaning":"A key word used in this lesson: homework.","part_of_speech":"noun","simple_definition":"A simple A1 meaning for ''homework''.","word":"homework"},{"audio_key":"a1_study_t05_l06_vocab_02","example":"I use the word ''home'' in this lesson.","image_key":"a1_study_t05_l06_vocab_02","meaning":"A key word used in this lesson: home.","part_of_speech":"verb","simple_definition":"A simple A1 meaning for ''home''.","word":"home"},{"audio_key":"a1_study_t05_l06_vocab_03","example":"I use the word ''library'' in this lesson.","image_key":"a1_study_t05_l06_vocab_03","meaning":"A key word used in this lesson: library.","part_of_speech":"adjective","simple_definition":"A simple A1 meaning for ''library''.","word":"library"},{"audio_key":"a1_study_t05_l06_vocab_04","example":"I use the word ''study'' in this lesson.","image_key":"a1_study_t05_l06_vocab_04","meaning":"A key word used in this lesson: study.","part_of_speech":"adverb","simple_definition":"A simple A1 meaning for ''study''.","word":"study"},{"audio_key":"a1_study_t05_l06_vocab_05","example":"I use the word ''relax'' in this lesson.","image_key":"a1_study_t05_l06_vocab_05","meaning":"A key word used in this lesson: relax.","part_of_speech":"expression","simple_definition":"A simple A1 meaning for ''relax''.","word":"relax"}]},"title":"After School"}'::jsonb, NOW(), NOW())
