The learner uses English in a realistic study situation focused on please speak slowly.', 2, '{"adaptive_learning":{"easy_path":["Remove sentence frames and add one unscripted follow-up question."],"review_triggers":[{"action":"Repeat pronunciation, controlled speaking, and guided dialogue before retrying.","condition":"Speaking score is below 65."},{"action":"Replay the model at slower speed with highlighted transcript support.","condition":"Listening accuracy is below 70."}],"standard_path":["Use visual support, model audio, guided dialogue, and the standard AI mission."],"support_path":["Show translations, keep sentence frames visible, slow audio to 0.75 speed, and allow phrase-by-phrase repetition."]},"assessment":{"checks":[{"answer":"Please speak slowly.","explanation":"This phrase directly supports the lesson mission.","item_id":"Q_01","options":["Please speak slowly.","Can you say it clearly?","That is too fast."],"points":10,"prompt":"Which phrase best helps you: ask for slower or clearer speech.","type":"multiple_choice"},{"answer":["Please speak slowly.","Can you say it clearly?","That is too fast."],"explanation":"The phrases follow the lesson''s communication sequence.","item_id":"Q_02","options":["Please speak slowly.","Can you say it clearly?","That is too fast."],"points":10,"prompt":"Put the short conversation in a logical order.","type":"ordering"},{"answer":"Learner recording scored by the speaking engine.","explanation":"Score task completion, intelligibility, and target-language use.","item_id":"Q_03","points":30,"prompt":"Repair a fast conversation.","type":"recording"}],"final_task":{"learner_instruction":"Repair a fast conversation. Speak for at least 30 seconds.","minimum_seconds":30,"required_language":["Please speak slowly.","Can you say it clearly?"],"rubric":[{"criterion":"task_completion","pass_description":"The learner completes the communication goal.","weight":0.4},{"criterion":"intelligibility","pass_description":"The learner is understandable to a patient listener.","weight":0.25},{"criterion":"vocabulary","pass_description":"The learner uses at least two target words or phrases.","weight":0.2},{"criterion":"confidence","pass_description":"The learner attempts the task without abandoning it.","weight":0.15}],"scenario":"Repair a fast conversation.","task_type":"ai_conversation"},"pass_score":65},"content_safety":{"age_rating":"all_ages","sensitive_topics":[]},"duration_minutes":12,"lesson_id":"A1_STUDY_T06_L03","lesson_number":3,"mission":"Ask for slower or clearer speech.","objectives":["Use key words and phrases to ask for slower or clearer speech.","Understand a short beginner-level model conversation.","Complete a spoken mission with understandable English."],"rewards":{"bonus_condition":"Complete the final mission on the first attempt.","bonus_xp":25,"streak_credit":true,"xp":100},"scenario":"The learner uses English in a realistic study situation focused on please speak slowly.","target_language":{"grammar":[{"common_errors":["Using the wrong word order.","Leaving out a necessary verb or helper word."],"communicative_use":"Use this pattern to ask for slower or clearer speech.","examples":["Please speak slowly.","Can you say it clearly?","That is too fast."],"pattern":"adverbs in requests","point":"adverbs in requests"}],"phrases":[{"audio_key":"a1_study_t06_l03_phrase_01","example":"Please speak slowly.","formality":"neutral","phrase":"Please speak slowly.","use_case":"Use this phrase to complete the lesson''s speaking mission."},{"audio_key":"a1_study_t06_l03_phrase_02","example":"Can you say it clearly?","formality":"neutral","phrase":"Can you say it clearly?","use_case":"Use this phrase to complete the lesson''s speaking mission."},{"audio_key":"a1_study_t06_l03_phrase_03","example":"That is too fast.","formality":"neutral","phrase":"That is too fast.","use_case":"Use this phrase to complete the lesson''s speaking mission."}],"pronunciation":[{"audio_key":"a1_study_t06_l03_pronunciation_01","common_error":"Speaking word by word with unclear stress.","focus":"Stress key words in polite requests for help.","model":"Please speak slowly.","tip":"Listen, pause, and repeat in one clear thought group."}],"vocabulary":[{"audio_key":"a1_study_t06_l03_vocab_01","example":"I use the word ''slowly'' in this lesson.","image_key":"a1_study_t06_l03_vocab_01","meaning":"A key word used in this lesson: slowly.","part_of_speech":"noun","simple_definition":"A simple A1 meaning for ''slowly''.","word":"slowly"},{"audio_key":"a1_study_t06_l03_vocab_02","example":"I use the word ''clearly'' in this lesson.","image_key":"a1_study_t06_l03_vocab_02","meaning":"A key word used in this lesson: clearly.","part_of_speech":"verb","simple_definition":"A simple A1 meaning for ''clearly''.","word":"clearly"},{"audio_key":"a1_study_t06_l03_vocab_03","example":"I use the word ''fast'' in this lesson.","image_key":"a1_study_t06_l03_vocab_03","meaning":"A key word used in this lesson: fast.","part_of_speech":"adjective","simple_definition":"A simple A1 meaning for ''fast''.","word":"fast"},{"audio_key":"a1_study_t06_l03_vocab_04","example":"I use the word ''voice'' in this lesson.","image_key":"a1_study_t06_l03_vocab_04","meaning":"A key word used in this lesson: voice.","part_of_speech":"adverb","simple_definition":"A simple A1 meaning for ''voice''.","word":"voice"},{"audio_key":"a1_study_t06_l03_vocab_05","example":"I use the word ''sound'' in this lesson.","image_key":"a1_study_t06_l03_vocab_05","meaning":"A key word used in this lesson: sound.","part_of_speech":"expression","simple_definition":"A simple A1 meaning for ''sound''.","word":"sound"}]},"title":"Please Speak Slowly"}'::jsonb, NOW(), NOW())
